ck to life. Do you have any pictures of it looking amazing? I'd love to see how it turned out!\nL26: [S21T5] (dia_id: D21:5)","content_sha256":"f226d517d247e242f2afa8f321cfe22fbc112ef46a5287bf679285b77b0ed789","coverage":[{"line_end":26,"line_start":14,"path":"/memories/session-21.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":13,"result_sha256":"155cca2b1dddec47c5dae80d88792c163bca2a5a0bb67dffc1bac35b31de32ad","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
